{"author":{"id":"694fb8161bd8bf91df2a28db7c649e48f8c5fa47ad3ad0234607d35f0482801a"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790459806,"nonce":"uL1cKGhzfy/lFw8oNYg6Gg9dbDk=","title":"Native --aot in releases has no libwren_lift.a to link","message":"Releases build wlift with `aot` so `--aot-target wasm32-wasip1` works from\nan installed binary. That also enables native `wlift --aot out file.wren`,\nwhich links against `libwren_lift.a` found via WLIFT_STATICLIB, beside the\nbinary, or in target/. Releases don't ship the staticlib, so an installed\nwlift answers native --aot with \"could not locate libwren_lift.a\".\n\nShipping it (per target, beside wlift, as the wasm runtime object is) or\nnaming the gap in the error message are the options; the wasm path is\nunaffected.","files":null}]}